<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine markets closed for Easter holiday.</title>
<headline>Argentine markets closed for Easter holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine financial and grain markets were closed Thursday and Friday for the Easter long weekend break. Trading resumes Monday.</p>
<p>(( - Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
